{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation with concat fusion in a multimodal multiprofile setup (pca_n2000 RNA, resnet50 image), isolating the aggregation strategy's impact. Validation accuracy (57.93%) and F1 (56.31%) are lower than the avgpool aggregation baseline (config_018: 61.86% accuracy, 61.03% F1), suggesting transformer aggregation may not improve performance in this context. The relative effectiveness of aggregation methods and interactions with fusion strategies remain uncertain without direct comparisons to other aggregation techniques."
}

